# Ownership for review routing.
#
# CODEOWNERS is NOT one of the community health files GitHub inherits from an
# owner's `.github` repository: it is read from this repository or not at all.
# `SECURITY.md` is the opposite case, which is why there is none here.
#
# Everything in this repository is published. `AGENTS.md` lands at the root of
# every consuming repository and is read by an agent before it does anything,
# and a moved tag delivers a change to all of them at once. There is no
# staging step between a commit here and that, so nothing changes without the
# owner seeing it.
